# VendorBridge Frontend Environment Configuration
# Base URL of the backend API service.
# In local development: Leave blank or set to http://localhost:5000 (Vite dev server proxies /api to http://localhost:5000).
# In production: Set to the full production backend origin, e.g. https://api.vendorbridge.com (or leave empty if hosted on same domain / behind reverse proxy).
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
